    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOPEN VIEWING SATURDAY 3rd October 12.30-1pm sharp.\n\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nThis well located 3 bedroom semi detached property is centrally located within walking distance of the beach and all local amenities. Internally, the property is presented for sale in excellent condition throughout with well proportioned accommodation (105 sq.m.) including a sitting room, open plan kitchen and dining area, bathroom and 3 bedrooms (one of which is ensuite). Externally, there is a well maintained, enclosed, private rear garden with patio seating area, a storage shed and tarmac drive with ample parking available. Due to the size and location of this property it would make a fabulous holiday home, retirement home or starter home. Early viewings are advisable. BER C."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nSitting room - \nLocated to the front of the property, this fine room is complete with laminate flooring, a bay style window and an electric fireplace.\n\nhallway - \nA bright and inviting hallway complete with tiled flooring\n\nKitchen/dining area - \nContemporary open plan layout complete with fully fitted wall and base units, tiled splash back and tiled flooring. The dining area has a free standing electric stove and access to a beautiful seating and patio area at the rear garden.\n\nLanding area - \nComplete with laminate flooring and recessed hot press with ample storage.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nTwin bedroom located to the front of the property with laminate flooring.\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled and complete with bath, wc whb\n\nBedroom 2 - \nThis fine double bedroom is also located to the front of the property and complete with laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nThis master bedroom is situated to the rear of the property, overlooking the rear garden and patio area. Flooded with natural sunlight and complete with laminate flooring and a balcony area\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Beautifully presented 3 bedroom semi detached home</li><li>Ideal location within walking distance of the beach and all amenities</li><li>Only four residential units in this area</li><li>Private property - no management fees</li><li>Enclosed rear garden with seating and patio area and storage shed</li><li>Low maintenance exterior finish, gardens and tarmac drive with ample parking</li><li>Mains services</ul>"
      },
